<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Aug car registrations rose 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Aug car registrations rose 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian new motor vehicle registrations rose a seasonally-adjusted 6.9 percent in August to 54,156, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Economists median forecast had been for a rise of around 3.9 percent.</p>
</text>
